  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《Ùi Charlie Kirk刺殺案講起》</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tân Lō͘</span></h1><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhUyTaBAZsjus1CbC28-iJ9Ug1xIOgd2zq66E6mCckuyMZlnJWEar3YmBaNulgpWeCvHn4ZNwezpdSZMh26XQPJHN-7w0G1p6-fbTSBtroua0U57_shR0H_pg5HNvY2ARlZUT32103z1R8xOFcq_o19QOQ0IdkniYTRPNUwaNgAUCsSoztktpPeDN7AXHo4\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhUyTaBAZsjus1CbC28-iJ9Ug1xIOgd2zq66E6mCckuyMZlnJWEar3YmBaNulgpWeCvHn4ZNwezpdSZMh26XQPJHN-7w0G1p6-fbTSBtroua0U57_shR0H_pg5HNvY2ARlZUT32103z1R8xOFcq_o19QOQ0IdkniYTRPNUwaNgAUCsSoztktpPeDN7AXHo4\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEimnOsqItC-Nf-eLHcU7hJkR0HwcyjFRXuKXPmpb_00kmVQsTs4_8Opp98_VKGXfusHDQZ1UshDfuy7w3-g9tQCB3VwG2APnaY4tqGhxHWnYxoRq83oVtDWsuDsaJPNmeaah-8zBN0MjF1sVBdsmMIJKmCzc3rsYezLxar6Eq1AfG7TL_-a6jgZHtENqh6z\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEimnOsqItC-Nf-eLHcU7hJkR0HwcyjFRXuKXPmpb_00kmVQsTs4_8Opp98_VKGXfusHDQZ1UshDfuy7w3-g9tQCB3VwG2APnaY4tqGhxHWnYxoRq83oVtDWsuDsaJPNmeaah-8zBN0MjF1sVBdsmMIJKmCzc3rsYezLxar6Eq1AfG7TL_-a6jgZHtENqh6z\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhcprxc1nJwix9CdjtTZ_G9ve7M0Z5Gsdk1574OOS9G8Zp5i1NxvSbbMkzXG-_nX28Uz5WvY5AaQolDiSTv8oY9DQljN_6F3dg1I1Hk691NCxH5qWTBedWJjGUiUT7FzFY54LuNffj5m23MKIQNIIq9NVhl5RKpWtgqVrDvBCwc81RLkSHIHEpIXAqlyXcY\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhcprxc1nJwix9CdjtTZ_G9ve7M0Z5Gsdk1574OOS9G8Zp5i1NxvSbbMkzXG-_nX28Uz5WvY5AaQolDiSTv8oY9DQljN_6F3dg1I1Hk691NCxH5qWTBedWJjGUiUT7FzFY54LuNffj5m23MKIQNIIq9NVhl5RKpWtgqVrDvBCwc81RLkSHIHEpIXAqlyXcY=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg5xObqHFt0enbGzyq8Xa6WDTNm4tZZyHTzHJ78yoPPsE3uVgmdN3l8Tf4TpoLJrkD1xaIF-oOV17Gay2UM-bsskDyvq7gqI2z8nF88tXYZAIuXyQd5C_mfE3zXDvi_lt0KGKesifwqkNB3GVOzU78XIpYlrhpZ6N6DOuoN53n5bKS6lBNo7iWZZnNhv5u-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg5xObqHFt0enbGzyq8Xa6WDTNm4tZZyHTzHJ78yoPPsE3uVgmdN3l8Tf4TpoLJrkD1xaIF-oOV17Gay2UM-bsskDyvq7gqI2z8nF88tXYZAIuXyQd5C_mfE3zXDvi_lt0KGKesifwqkNB3GVOzU78XIpYlrhpZ6N6DOuoN53n5bKS6lBNo7iWZZnNhv5u-=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">今年（2025年）9月初10 Charlie Kirk（編註：右派政治人物）tī美國Utah Valley大學演講期間，hō͘一个主張「反法西斯主義」、22歲ê少年人，ùi附近學校大樓ê厝尾頂，kō͘來福銃（Rifle）tōaⁿ著伊ê頷頸仔，chŏaⁿ過身死--去，hit時Charlie Kirk 31歲，10月14是伊32歲ê生日。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Charlie Kirk 18歲就創辦TPUSA（Turning Point U.S.A.），目的真清楚，伊感覺學校教育siuⁿ過頭teh chhui-sak「多元、包容無sio-siâng、進步ê價值觀」，對美國建國ê理想、基本價值kap基督教信仰ê原則，愈來愈無beh堅持kap傳承。伊感覺che真無公平，mā無道理，thài ē為著beh進步soah來放sak chit个國家在來、徛起ê基本精神--neh？所擺，伊主動離開學校教育系統，創辦TPUSA，堅心beh對美國社會貢獻伊ê性命力，提醒美國人ài尊chhûn家己國家ê建國精神kap價值。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">伊對美國大學教育真濟批評ê觀點，lóng記錄tī《The College Scam》chit本冊內底。伊m̄-nā是冊寫寫--leh就準煞，koh積極tī學校、公共場合辦演講宣傳，kap人面對面交流意見、辯論，tī少年人箍仔chiâⁿ做出名ê意見頭人。對價值sio仝ê政黨kap政治參與者，伊mā公開表達家己ê立場，無am-khàm、閃bih。Tī美國民主黨Obama總統執政ê時chūn，一个少年人beh舞chit款社會運動，實在是罕見koh勇敢，有志氣koh有才情。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">是按怎，落尾手竟然Charlie Kirk ē hông用chit款公開暗殺、政治暴力ê方式對待？</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Che tio̍h-ài ùi美國社會內底「進步價值走精」講起。Chia先講結論，社交媒體對極端言論kap假口座風聲，政府無制定適當ê管制、處理規則是真要緊ê因端。Koh來，chiah是政治政策「過頭進步」，直接用政策制限人表達ê內容——也就是「政治正確ê語言」chiâⁿ做法律規定，強迫所有人ài家己做言論、語詞審查，結果濟濟怪奇、烏龍se̍h桌ê政治新詞愈來愈濟。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">另外一个上爭議--ê，就是性別議題kap政策，衝突siuⁿ過傷重--ah。就是khang-khòe招--人，性別比例soah khah要緊本身專業ê能力。為著beh符合性別比例規定ê人數，硬beh用無夠額才調ê人，甚至為著保障多元性別，hō͘ hit款精神koh-iūⁿ、kō͘「性別流動」做神主牌仔、sì-kè騙食討趁ê人，安排khang-khòe hō͘--in，致使產生營業風險甚至公共風險。Koh有「共用便所」、「hāⁿ性別者參與運動比賽」等等問題。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Che若無特別去閱讀、思考kap了解，lán看無tī Tâi-oân未來ē產生仝款ê問題，人美國chit-má已經開始teh反省kap改變--ah。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">自Trump總統第一任期進前，Charlie Kirk早就teh主張美國人ài有智覺、ài警覺chia-ê相關問題，tī hit時chūn伊hông當做「保守思想、傳統àu臭、khiàn-sńg無進步」。Tī YouTube頂面lán去聽伊hām人辯論，雖bóng lán無的確完全認同伊ê觀點，m̄-koh lán ē用得家己思考，準換做是家己徛踮伊面頭前kap伊論理，無一定ài講kah輸贏，kám有khah好、khah完整ê理路？</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Charlie Kirk ê理論核心是「保守主義」（Conservatism），in ê理路若beh簡單講，就是徛tī「維持社會系統穩定，無趕緊追求進步、改變，沓沓仔調整、改善，堅持尊chhûn、傳承有傳統、歷史ê價值觀。」Che hām中國話內底講ê『保守』意思無sio-siâng。Conservatism是美國、歐洲民族國家起造ê基本架構，甚至是精神基礎。上古早ē用得稽考到希臘ê哲學家Socrates（『蘇格拉底』），伊上出名就是做「公共辯論」chit層代誌，mā是西洋社會上注重ê獨立思考、堅持理念價值ê代表人物。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">真拄好，in兩人過身lóng是hō͘反對ê人hē手chŏaⁿ離開--ê，in兩人lóng是徛tī「用理念kap言論戰鬥，想beh改善社會制度」，過身了後，留hō͘逐家心肝壁頂一大縫pit巡，hō͘願意停跤ê人siàu念kap反省。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán真正beh追求族群ê進步kap發展，a̍h是為著目睭前看ē著ê贏面kap爽快？Beh留hō͘後代囝孫啥mih款ê社會kap價值，kám就免斟酌、免khêng分計較？</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">上落尾，我想beh ke問--兩-句-仔，攑中國流亡車輪旗hoah台灣m̄免koh建國，án-ne kám有影是進步？唱中國國民黨創ê「國歌」kám是進步？尊chhûn蔣經國kap宋美齡chia-ê蹧躂lán Tâi-oân人 ê殖民者kám真正有khah進步？</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br /></div></div><div><span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2129\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ=w448-h640\" width=\"448\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">台文通訊BONG報 380期,Lán來講看māi,</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXe